            <eid>7bt4mqZFaOL_4f6NSCiO5EJ</eid>
            <minDistance>0.298968</minDistance>
            <offset x="-10.6763" y="-0.796802"/>
            <text>Technically, these notes don't play, and there are invisible drum notes making the percussive sound.</text>
